## Steg 2 — koppla mot live-server-v3 istället för mockClient.ts.
## Kopiera denna fil till .env.local (git-ignorerad) och avkommentera:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://localhost:5285/api/v1
## (ADR 001: the console's session is a cookie on the API's host, so the API must be https on the same site as the
## console — live-server-v3's dev-kit profile serves https://localhost:5285.)
## ungap Shell (UNG-322): shell origins allowed to frame the console, comma separated (https://localhost:5180 is always allowed in dev)
# VITE_SHELL_ORIGINS=https://shell.example
## ungap Presenter (steps A7/A7b): the users view links SSO domains to its Organisation view (https://localhost:5180 in dev)
# VITE_PRESENTER_URL=https://presenter.example
